@namespace Blazix.Primitives.Fixtures.Client.CompositeFixtures
@using Blazix.Primitives
@inherits CompositeFixtureBase

@*
    The `composite-nested` fixture (tests/browser/composite.spec.ts): Base UI's NestedItemsRoot (CompositeRoot.test.tsx),
    for "keeps outer metadata and focus navigation when items share a DOM node" (CMP-STR-04, CMP-STA-29; M3 track 1, E3
    and E4). A horizontal root that derives its disabled indices from the items' flags holds a first item focusable when
